From 6e3e4397b03fd47db6af060c3e03a61243903ee6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 01:08:36 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(2d): hold blended Zigzag turns to the crossing law

The closing rings can meet a blended row turn. The Zigzag pocket now posts its blends through the crossing check, as the rest pocket does. The motion corner_blend law needs no change again.

Refs #3021

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
